{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "047shu_401_2_4_047_01_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:3da33153b5ccdd62d3cc328c2988d013d2dfe5c22e835815d7c48908f1575f3a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:047shu_401_2_4_047_01_09_b:2_4_047_01_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecab93baf64da3d22e1c04cf85947d8b0a7228ff6c132a631107f5dd52b6ca89",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー？\n现在方便说话吗？我想聊聊今天演出的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_401_2_4_047_01_09_b:2_4_047_01_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99c9dcfc34667485bcf01b7c8efbd71424c02fbf1578a01012163389cd2d0856",
      "text": "你应该也有话想对我说吧？\n……演得很好？真是的，这句刚才已经听你说过了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_401_2_4_047_01_09_b:2_4_047_01_09_b:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70688119572889b60301d2761042f6f0f7f3eb348cbfb2e90da219fb385a8d01",
      "text": "不过，我懂你那种想反复说的感受啦。\n社交媒体上也全都是这类好评。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_401_2_4_047_01_09_b:2_4_047_01_09_b:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d62b4e1d75cc5f3b5f13ac2f17968193e1cecf4857e1d9ca5d45e05878173ad",
      "text": "但我们的实力可不仅限于此。下次会让你看到更厉害的。\n……你也跟其他人一样，好好期待着吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_401_2_4_047_01_09_b:2_4_047_01_09_b:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:daf6501aae41dc1f23d1500f4b216f9837be02a82e80575cced2b8b3d1f406b4",
      "text": "我想说的就这些。挂了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
